{"id":"u-210b07fa-b629-4eee-a4a7-d762bb3f5efc","src":"community","title":"Guts lonely PureBodybuilding PPL (Homegym edition)","author":"Daven L.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/AldLn4-jn-purebodybuilding-upper-lower-homegym-edition","desc":"A full-body strength and hypertrophy program using free weights only, designed to maximize muscle growth, joint range of motion, and functional strength without relying on machines or cables.”\n\nKey points:\n\nStrength & Power – Squats, deadlifts, bench press, overhead press, and RDLs target your major lifts and compound strength.\n\nHypertrophy / Muscle Sculpting – Isolation exercises (flyes, curls, triceps extensions, lateral raises, pullovers) target specific muscles for size and shape.\n\nFull Range of Motion & Tension Control – Many exercises focus on stretch, pause, or super-ROM to maximize muscle activation.\n\nEquipment Efficiency – Uses only barbells, dumbbells, benches, SSB, arm blaster, and plates—no machines required.\n\nBalanced Upper & Lower Body Development – Covers legs, chest, back, shoulders, arms, and core.\n\nIn short, the program is a machine-free, high-quality, full-body program for building both strength and muscle with precise tension and range of motion.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:13:57.489Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["PULL 1","PUSH 1","LEGS 1","ARMS & WEAKPOINTS 1"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":2}],"note":"Snatch grip"},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pullover (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Preacher Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)